          "en": "I couldn’t sleep all night; the foghorn kept moaning on the Sound, and I tossed between strange reality and wild, scary dreams. As dawn approached, I heard a taxi drive up Gatsby’s driveway, and I immediately jumped out of bed to get dressed—I felt I needed to tell him something important, something that couldn’t wait until morning.",
